1
00:00:00,581 --> 00:00:02,660
My grandpa loves to grow flowers
我爷爷喜欢种花

2
00:00:02,661 --> 00:00:05,557
He has a big garden full of colorful flowers
他有一个开满五颜六色花朵的大花园

3
00:00:05,799 --> 00:00:06,581
Every morning
每天早晨

4
00:00:06,581 --> 00:00:09,278
he waters the plants and talks to them
他给植物浇水并与它们交谈

5
00:00:09,621 --> 00:00:11,997
Grandpa knows all the names of the flowers
爷爷知道所有花的名字

6
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,837
He teaches me how to take care of the plants
他教我如何照顾植物

7
00:00:14,941 --> 00:00:17,500
We spend a lot of time together in the garden
我们花了很多时间在花园里

8
00:00:17,501 --> 00:00:20,117
The flowers make our garden very beautiful
这些花使我们的花园非常漂亮

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,699
Grandpa's favorite flower is the rose
爷爷最喜欢的花是玫瑰花

10
00:00:22,701 --> 00:00:24,500
I Love helping him in the garden
我喜欢在花园里帮他

11
00:00:24,501 --> 00:00:26,077
and learning about flowers
学习花

